}
```

Add reset() to SyncEngine.

For MockMvc test use @AutoConfigureMockMvc.

Note H2 shared named db "sensor_sync_test" with DB_CLOSE_DELAY=-1 persists across context; cleanup handles isolation.

Write SyncEngine.reset() first.

